{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Largo",
    "steam_appid": 2870910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.poster.avif?t=1711009431\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.webm?t=1711009431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.mp4?t=1711009431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Largo!</h2>Largo is a game in the style of <strong>I'm on Observation Duty</strong>, where you monitor security cameras and spot differences in various locations.<br><br>Enter a world with an eerie post-apocalyptic atmosphere where humanity has disappeared without a trace. As a survivor, your task is to examine different abandoned and liminal spaces, and report anomalies.<br><br>Stay vigilant for unexpected guests and make it through to dawn!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Report hundreds of anomalies across four dilapidated settings: an arctic log cabin, an office space, a supermarket and an opera house<br></li><li> Click on objects to file a report<br></li><li> Select from four levels of difficulty<br></li><li> Encounter a wide array of anomalies, from the easily noticeable to those that are incredibly subtle<br></li><li> Face entities in various spine-chilling scenarios<br></li><li> Earn Steam Achievements for conquering the Nightmare mode and reporting Special Anomalies</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.poster.avif?t=1711009431\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.webm?t=1711009431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.mp4?t=1711009431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Largo!</h2>Largo is a game in the style of <strong>I'm on Observation Duty</strong>, where you monitor security cameras and spot differences in various locations.<br><br>Enter a world with an eerie post-apocalyptic atmosphere where humanity has disappeared without a trace. As a survivor, your task is to examine different abandoned and liminal spaces, and report anomalies.<br><br>Stay vigilant for unexpected guests and make it through to dawn!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Report hundreds of anomalies across four dilapidated settings: an arctic log cabin, an office space, a supermarket and an opera house<br></li><li> Click on objects to file a report<br></li><li> Select from four levels of difficulty<br></li><li> Encounter a wide array of anomalies, from the easily noticeable to those that are incredibly subtle<br></li><li> Face entities in various spine-chilling scenarios<br></li><li> Earn Steam Achievements for conquering the Nightmare mode and reporting Special Anomalies</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become a security camera operator and survey an abandoned world. Spot any differences and report mysterious anomalies before it's too late. Will you survive the night?",
